	(text "ADDRESS LATCHES, THE TWO RAMS, THE FONT EPROM AND ITS COPY, THE MAD BUFFERS, THEIR CONTROL" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06f7ca4a-8a4b-5ef0-8fa2-498d0d10ae68"))
	(text "IC8 / IC9 hold MAD0-15 while AS is high. The RAM where MA19 is low or CHR is high, the font (IC14, its byte on\nboth halves through IC15) where MA19 is high; CHR (a character screen) forces A16-18 high (IC36).\nMOE (IC18/B) = NAND(VALID, AS, NOT W): the memories drive the data lines from the end of AS to the end of the\ncycle, never in a drawing write (W, IC17/A). -WE = NAND(P56, W). IC12 / IC13 between the RAM and MAD in a\ndrawing cycle: IC37/A, on in dots 5-7 of a write and 6-7 of a read. JP4: pin 30 of the RAMs, CE2 or A17." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9794c74f-8fe1-58fa-9bab-7acfa6756383"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
